Cargo is MIT-licensed, WITH EXCEPTIONS.

The MIT grant below covers Cargo's own application code. It does NOT cover
every file in this repository. Some vendored and ported material carries terms
that are more restrictive than MIT — in particular two Shadertoy shader ports
under CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, which is not an OSI open-source licence and forbids
commercial use, and a shader port under MIT + Commons Clause. There is also an
unresolved permission question covering most of the text-animation set.

Every exception is enumerated in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Read that file before
reusing any part of this project, and treat it as controlling wherever it and
this file disagree. Because of those carve-outs, Cargo as a whole is
source-available for commercial purposes rather than fully open source.

